          "entities": {},
          "text": "This is a Fadiel AC2002 Wireless Satellite Accelerator, a vehicle modification for drivers with limited leg mobility. \nIt allows the user to control acceleration without taking their hands off the steering wheel. \nThe device is worn like a glove, and acceleration is managed by applying thumb pressure to a small lever. \nIt uses Bluetooth technology for wireless operation, ensuring no external interference. \nThis design minimizes shoulder fatigue and facilitates driving with both hands on the wheel. \nIt is an electronic control system designed to provide maximum freedom of movement and precise acceleration for drivers."
